- If elapsed >= 400ms: set scale to 1, deactivate, remove from manager
- Else if elapsed < 200ms: scale = 1 + 0.5 * (elapsed / 200)
- Else: scale = 1.5 - 0.5 * ((elapsed - 200) / 200)

