1. ✅ Pulse takes scale from 1 to 1.5 over 0.2s (200ms) at steady rate (linear)
2. ✅ Then back down to 1 over next 0.2s (200ms) at steady rate
3. ✅ Button rests at 1 after
4. ✅ Nothing moves before first press (no task is created until the returned function is called)
5. ✅ Every press starts a new pulse from the beginning (removes old task, creates new one with elapsed=0)
